        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ops-text" value="The Decider task is started on demand (aws ecs update-service --desired-count 1) and costs about $0.99/hour while it runs, idle included; it is stopped again after use.  ·  Logs keep ids, enums and timings for one week, never observations or tokens.  ·  Future wind, the random seed and the spectator's prediction never leave the browser." style="fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#163047;text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=15;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
